window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Valens has noticed his two missing employees. It won't be long before he knows who is responsible. It won't be long before he claims his vengeance.<br> <br> The race is on.<br> <br> Kieran and Lexi must scrape together an army worthy of taking on the Demigod of San Francisco before he destroys them all.<br> <br> But Valens isn't Lexi's only problem.<br> <br> Mordecai's rapid recovery has been noticed, and he has once again become a threat to his old pack. Lexi's little family is in jeopardy of being torn apart, and to save them...she must finally embrace what she is.<br> <br> Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!<br> <br> Performed by Yenni Ann, Yasmin Tuazon, Alex Hill-Knight, Kay Eluvian, Holly Adams, Robb Moreira, Lena Lee, Rayner Gabriel, Gabriel Michael, David Cui Cui, Aure Nash, Alexandra Cohler, Andrew James Spooner, Bradley Foster Smith, Christopher Walker, Christopher Williams, Danny Gavigan, Donald Guzzi, Drew Kopas, Jeri J. Marshall, Jessica Threet, Joey Sourlis, Jonathon Church, Karen Novack, Marissa Clay, Matthew Pauli, Matthew Schleigh, Megan Hastie, Michael Glenn, Michael John Casey, Nick DePinto, Nora Achrati, Ryan Haugen, Samantha Cooper, Shanta Parasuraman, Steve Wannall, and Terence Aselford.</p>"; 
